  "description": "Create sweet and timeless baby designs with this gender neutral baby shower clipart PNG set, featuring soft watercolor newborn animals, storks, ducks, an elephant, baby carriage, balloons, stars, florals, gifts and whimsical nursery elements.\nThis watercolor baby clipart bundle is perfect for baby shower invitations, birth announcements, nursery wall art, milestone cards, party decor, scrapbooking, stickers, sublimation projects, greeting cards and other newborn-themed digital designs.\nThe collection has a soft pastel palette with blue, yellow and pink accents, making it ideal for gender neutral baby themes, surprise gender baby showers, first birthday designs and magical “baby is coming” projects.\nI N C L U D E D\n♥ 68 individual high-resolution DIY elements as PNG files with transparent backgrounds\n♥ 300 DPI high-resolution images, ensuring every detail is crisp and clear at any size",
